  "description": "BarcodeLib.Ocr library enables OCR feature to read Nepali text from image, tiff, scanned PDF file in ASP.NET Web, WinForms, WPF Windows applications.\n\nThis Tesseract Ocr language package includes training data:\n* Nepali language\n\nThis nuget package includes :\n* Tesseract OCR (Optical Character Recognition) engine to convert image, multi-page TIFF, PDF to editable text content in .NET apps\n* Nepali language supported\n* QR Code and 20+ 1d, 2d barcode scanning\n* Convert scanned PDF to text editable PDF documents\n\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\n\nContact :\n* Email : support@barcodelib.com",
  "iconFile": "Logo.png",
